\pard\b 25. Troubleshooting index\par
\pard\b0\par
\pard\b Portal unreachable from control room\par
\pard Check Operator portal URL, DNS, reverse proxy, host and upstream firewall, and service Running state.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Device offline\par
\pard Check Device ID, Type on BWC IP and SIP port, SIP password, routing, and BWC SIP firewall row.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Live video fails while device Online\par
\pard Check media/RTP firewall rows, media transport setting, operator workstation path to live video ports, and Chapter 18 if supporting media containers are part of this site.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Video Conference fails\par
\pard Confirm entitlement, then Chapter 18 (engine and conference containers), then conference firewall rows.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b License faults\par
\pard Hardware ID mismatch or edited file \emdash see Chapter 5 and 22.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Clock faults\par
\pard Correct BIOS and OS time; restore NTP; restart service.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Password / first sign-in\par
\pard Meet on-screen rules; factory password cannot be kept; see Installation Guide.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Reverse proxy login oddities\par
\pard Align Trust reverse proxy with real TLS termination; re-save; restart if instructed.\par
\pard\sa120\par
\pard\b Optional module missing\par
\pard Confirm license entitlement; contact Ubitron if the module should be present.\par
\pard\sa360\par

